ence feature.</media:description></media:content></item><item><title>Open Model Wars + Claire Stapleton’s Dishy Google Memoir + Substack’s Slop Fight</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/31/podcasts/open-source-google.html?partner=rss&amp;emc=rss</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/31/podcasts/open-source-google.html?partner=rss&amp;emc=rss</guid><atom:link rel="standout" href="https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/31/podcasts/open-source-google.html?partner=rss&amp;emc=rss" /><description>“It just seems like the temperature is rising on Silicon Valley.”</description><dc:creator>Kevin Roose, Casey Newton, Whitney Jones, Vjeran Pavic, Katie McMurran, Dan Powell, Rowan Niemisto, Chris Wood and Alyssa Moxley</dc:creator><pubDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 11:00:03 GMT</pubDate><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">science</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">NVIDIA</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">Claire Stapleton</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">Google</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">Substack</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">Artificial intelligence</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">internal-open-access-audio</category><media:content url="https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/07/31/podcasts/31hardfork-openletters/31hardfork-openletters-videoSixteenByNineJumbo1600.png" medium="image"><media:credit>The New York Times</media:credit></media:content></item></channel></rss>